    "Description": "Letter to Mrs. W.W. Farley from Gordon D. Newby from the Department of Mediterranean Studies at the Brandeis University Graduate School of Arts and Sciences in Waltham, Massachusetts. The letter is dated to July 14, 1976, and discusses Gordon D. Newby's father, Gordon L. Newby as a potential restorer for the Pullen Park Carousel. The letter includes information about Newby's upcoming move to Raleigh and contact information for his father. Signed by Newby at the bottom. ",
